  "name": "彩特琳德",
  "desc": "<pre><code>一位在風息山的療養院調查姊姊失蹤案的少女。</code></pre>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/08/368338997/fe53e5366fc7122592ee0c57eadab051_4393928398309112338.png",
